      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>When within Medium Range of a Heretic Leader (or higher) character, the Blessed Blade may spend their Reaction to immediately move to Defend (IM CRB pg. 207) the Leader. If doing so were to cause the Blessed Blade to break Engagement (IM CRB pg. 212), their opponents have Disadvantage on their melee attack. If the Blessed Blade successfully defends the Leader, the character may then immediately Run as an immediate Free Action, counting as having Disengaged if necessary.</p>"
