      "_id": "JhQr1HNu3hiBxNGX",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>It is impossible to Seduce a Blessed Blade, and attempts to Charm or Intimidate them have their difficulty increased by one level. As proof of their loyalty, Blessed Blades are incapable of speaking (either by ritual or other methods). As long as there is a Leader (or Higher) level Heretic or Chaos Character within the Combat, the Blessed Blade can never become Desperate. (Resolve is listed as 'Special' in the source and is set to 0 here for lack of an automatable value.)</p>"
        },
